          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:472ab9aeb55829dc8064f571725a5eaef96f91671430d2f4d1d82938161cc06f:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://locales/en/session.json#L1-L53",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:058ab81cac5c4627402f980e3f9c25717b5a216a7490b52edd51ae2280a8c764:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9581d50ce0f2473499dd2880cad7fdc4",
      "statement": "Twelve UI languages ship today (en, vi, ja, zh-CN, zh-TW, ko, es, fr, de, pt-BR, ru, th), and the list is declared once in `UI_LANGUAGES` in `lib/i18n/index.ts`, pairing each code with its native name for the language picker.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://components/LanguagePicker.tsx#L13-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4f8a518c5a0d1239b6109c9e5d5f8821db0378383a507dbfae919a5f79cadab7:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/i18n/index.ts#L13-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:84603267d326a5836acc2621d00ab30f00608c1c5a7e09a91b7b961d1d0047e7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_59268f710deb4af9b057b580dcdb384f",
      "statement": "All locale files are bundled into the extension at build time through Vite's `import.meta.glob` over `../../locales/*/*.json`, so there is no runtime fetch of a locale file, and i18next is initialized synchronously with `fallbackLng: 'en'`, `defaultNS: 'common'`, `escapeValue: false` and `initAsync: false`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/i18n/index.ts#L32-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2d246b109b8c1a4285b38a33b2a3f36cb0aa7abb155e6bbf388b7123c15f927e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/i18n/index.ts#L71-L82",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3b0af618e011cf3eeb90e1fe6d855971f4394319306363882af71efe4ff7bbe9:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1ddb1a1a47734fa6b79901dbfeb94e26",
      "statement": "`lib/i18n/index.ts` has no React dependency and exports a bound `t` so plain `lib/` code and the background can translate directly, while `lib/i18n/react.ts` registers the same instance with `initReactI18next` and each UI entrypoint imports it so `useTranslation()` works.",
