    {
      "id": "claim_f93adc43a3484e1a97b1a40d9e6392fc",
      "statement": "`components/Themed.tsx` mounts `<I18nextProvider>` and applies the interface language with `setUiLanguage(settings.uiLanguage)`, but only when it is the root instance, so an embedded Settings draft does not switch the whole page's language before the user saves.",
