      "id": "claim_5a09600e3f2945a38f9baf77e73a4a13",
      "statement": "Error messages are translated at the moment they are produced: `lib/llm.ts`, `lib/models.ts`, `lib/page.ts`, `lib/extractors.ts` and `lib/settings.ts` build user-facing error text with `t('errors:…')` from the `errors` namespace.",
